& [Observed]
  + pre-publication receipt review found that each operation enforced maximum_process_seconds7200 but the sum of admitted operation durations did not enforce maximum_total_seconds36000

& [Impact]
  + a redigested receipt could have represented seven individually bounded operations whose cumulative duration exceeded the signed commission total bound
  + the omission was found before implementation publication and before any package remote host call Cargo effect or physical build

& [Correction]
  + receipt validation now uses checked cumulative millisecond addition and refuses immediately when the fixed total bound is exceeded
  + a seven-record adversarial fixture stays within every per-process bound while exceeding the total bound and must refuse
  + the obsolete in-progress release workspace run was stopped before rerunning focused and exact-current-tree gates

& [Prevention]
  + package and live receipt reviews must compare each scalar bound with its aggregate counterpart before publication
